            "id": "https://xubiaolin.github.io/2025/11/12/huan-jing-wen-ti/docker-proxy-zi-jian/",
            "url": "https://xubiaolin.github.io/2025/11/12/huan-jing-wen-ti/docker-proxy-zi-jian/",
            "title": "Docker Proxy自建",
            "date_published": "2025-11-12T07:41:54.000Z",
            "content_html": "<blockquote>\n<p>Docker 镜像 pull 一直是个老大难的问题，国内网络环境复杂，镜像源经常被墙，导致无法正常 pull 镜像。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"Docker-Proxy-自建\"><a href=\"#Docker-Proxy-自建\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Docker Proxy 自建\"></a>Docker Proxy 自建</h2><p>本次部署依赖项目 <a href=\"https://github.com/dqzboy/Docker-Proxy\"><code>dqzboy/Docker-Proxy</code></a>，用于自建 Docker Hub 代理加速服务。</p>\n<h3 id=\"准备工作\"><a href=\"#准备工作\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"准备工作\"></a>准备工作</h3><ul>\n<li>一台具备公网访问的服务器</li>\n<li>预装 Docker 环境</li>\n<li>可选：Caddy（或任意反向代理）</li>\n<li>可选：域名（用于配置 HTTPS）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"安装-Docker\"><a href=\"#安装-Docker\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"安装 Docker\"></a>安装 Docker</h3><p>如需快速安装 Docker，可执行官方安装脚本并指定阿里云镜像加速：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">curl -fsSL https://get.docker.com | bash -s docker --mirror Aliyun</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"编写-docker-compose-yml\"><a href=\"#编写-docker-compose-yml\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"编写 docker-compose.yml\"></a>编写 <code>docker-compose.yml</code></h3><p>示例配置仅启动 Docker Hub 代理，其余仓库示例保持注释：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight yaml\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"attr\">services:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"attr\">dockerhub:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attr\">container_name:</span> <span class=\"string\">reg-docker-hub</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attr\">image:</span> <span class=\"string\">dqzboy/registry:latest</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attr\">restart:</span> <span class=\"string\">always</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attr\">environment:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"bullet\">-</span> <span class=\"string\">OTEL_TRACES_EXPORTER=none</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"comment\"># - http=http://host:port</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"comment\"># - https=http://host:port</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attr\">volumes:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"bullet\">-</span> <span class=\"string\">./registry/data:/var/lib/registry</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"bullet\">-</span> <span class=\"string\">./registry-hub.yml:/etc/distribution/config.yml</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"comment\"># - ./htpasswd:/auth/htpasswd</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attr\">ports:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"bullet\">-</span> <span class=\"number\">51000</span><span class=\"string\">:5000</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attr\">networks:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"bullet\">-</span> <span class=\"string\">registry-net</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"comment\"># 其他源示例，按需取消注释</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"comment\"># ghcr:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"comment\">#   container_name: reg-ghcr</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"comment\">#   image: dqzboy/registry:latest</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"comment\">#   restart: always</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"comment\">#   environment:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"comment\">#     - OTEL_TRACES_EXPORTER=none</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"comment\">#   volumes:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"comment\">#     - ./registry/data:/var/lib/registry</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"comment\">#     - ./registry-ghcr.yml:/etc/distribution/config.yml</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"comment\">#   ports:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"comment\">#     - 52000:5000</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"comment\">#   networks:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"comment\">#     - registry-net</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"attr\">networks:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"attr\">registry-net:</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"下载-registry-配置\"><a href=\"#下载-registry-配置\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"下载 registry 配置\"></a>下载 registry 配置</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">wget https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dqzboy/Docker-Proxy/refs/heads/main/config/registry-hub.yml</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"启动服务\"><a href=\"#启动服务\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"启动服务\"></a>启动服务</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">docker compose up -d</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"配置反向代理（可选）\"><a href=\"#配置反向代理（可选）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"配置反向代理（可选）\"></a>配置反向代理（可选）</h3><p>以 Caddy 为例，将公共域名流量转发至本地服务：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">hub.yourdomain.com {</span><br><span class=\"line\">    reverse_proxy localhost:51000 {</span><br><span class=\"line\">        header_up Host {host}</span><br><span class=\"line\">        header_up X-Real-IP {remote_addr}</span><br><span class=\"line\">        header_up X-Forwarded-For {remote_addr}</span><br><span class=\"line\">        header_up X-Nginx-Proxy true</span><br><span class=\"line\">    }</span><br><span class=\"line\">}</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"验证\"><a href=\"#验证\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"验证\"></a>验证</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">docker pull hub.yourdomain.com/library/hello-world</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n<h1 id=\"参考链接\"><a href=\"#参考链接\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"参考链接\"></a>参考链接</h1><p><a href=\"https://github.com/dqzboy/Docker-Proxy\">https://github.com/dqzboy/Docker-Proxy</a></p>\n",
            "tags": [
                "Docker",
                "Proxy"
            ]
        }
    ]
}